# Latency bench — the 2026-09-24 scheduling pass (DIVERGENCES.md §8.1)
#
# Captured in this sandbox on 2026-09-24 (Node v22, PGlite over the Postgres
# wire protocol, per-role latency injection standing in for BluesMinds:
# observer 900ms, strategist 1200ms, search fetch 500ms + briefing 1500ms,
# specialist/synthesizer 2500ms, coherence 1200ms, critic 1100ms,
# memory relevance 800ms, memory extraction 1000ms, summary 900ms).
# The sequential run was captured with the scheduling change stashed; the
# scheduled run with it applied. Same database, same seeded memories,
# median of 2 measured turns per scenario.
#
# Reproduce with:  node test/latency-bench.mjs --scenario=search-decomp

